  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Medical Procurement Organization (Soha-2) Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at increasing the domestic manufacturing capability
of a large number of drugs/medicines including antibiotics to meet the
local demand and through the substitution of imports. The project scope includes civil works, production equipment for solids, liquids and antibiotics. Upon completion, SOHA_2 will produce 313 medicines. Another important objective of the project is to establish a center for pharmaceutical research and analytical studies. The project will be located in Karaj _ Kanal Shahr Industrial Zone some 52 KM from Tehran adjacent to the existing Plant (SOHA_l) which is producing 39 families of products of disposable, &quot;one_time_use&quot; type. The technology tor antibiotic and R&amp;D center including the required laboratories will be provided by Sagepharm Co., Geneva, Switzerland.</narrative>
  </description>
